# ⚠ WHY THIS FILE EXISTS.
#
# GitHub's language bar read this repository as "HTML 68.2%", which is wrong and
# was actively misleading about what the project is. Two causes, both fixed:
#
#   1. public/images/colab_dom.html — a 421 KB saved DOM dump that had nothing
#      to do with the site. Deleted.
#   2. public/chip8/ — the Emscripten output of the CHIP-8 emulator: a generated
#      shell page and a megabyte of generated glue JavaScript. It is a build
#      artifact of a C++ project, not source of this one.
#
# Marking the emulator build vendored keeps it in the repo (the page needs it to
# boot) while telling Linguist not to count it. The app itself is TypeScript and
# React, and the bar should say so.
public/chip8/** linguist-vendored

# The hand-written embed shell is ours, but it is still not representative of
# what this repository is for.
public/chip8/embed.html linguist-vendored

# Generated placeholder art.
public/images/*-light.png linguist-generated
